author=lemonrsh
description=Level 2 v1: module CPU-overhead and stability optimizations only - native FOD event filtering, fewer redundant writes/process scans and clean refresh shutdown. Existing 0.4x animations, 144 Hz normal / 120 Hz FOD, reversible settings, 4266/1866 MHz screen-aware DRAM lock, HAL patch, HBM thermal/watchdog safety and download fixes are unchanged.
